OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer sacked over message
OL,4,Ato sex worker
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Leicestershire Police officer has
OL,7,Fbeen sacked for "intentionally"
OL,8,Fcontacting a sex worker despite
OL,9,Fclaiming he had been searching for
OL,10,Fmassages online.
OL,12,FA misconduct hearing held at the
OL,13,Fforce's headquarters in Enderby heard
OL,14,Fhow Officer A - who cannot be named due
OL,15,Fto an anonymity order ` texted a number
OL,16,Fconnected with a prostitute in
OL,17,FSeptember 2024.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
