OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer sacked over message
OL,4,Ato sex worker
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe panel heard the officer insisted he
OL,7,Fhad been searching for legitimate
OL,8,Fmasseuses, but could not recall how he
OL,9,Fhad got the number and had redacted his
OL,10,Fbank statements and failed to hand over
OL,11,Fphone data.
OL,13,FDismissing him with immediate effect,
OL,14,FChief Constable David Sandall told the
OL,15,Fhearing the officer's story "doesn't
OL,16,Fsit right".
